Appendix D: Numerical Benchmark and Simulation Scenarios

To support the theoretical claims, we outline a benchmark network of n = 100 digesters with random geometric graph topology (radius R = 1.5 km, density 50 households/km²). Feedstock inputs are generated from the Poisson‑Markov model with parameters estimated from rural Karnataka, India. Simulations (performed in MATLAB/Simulink with ADMM solver) confirm:

